2. Derived names:
   - worktree <worktrees>/<slug-id> (lifecycle.rs:513; config.rs:184 for transients);
   - <machine>/config/<slug-id> (transient.rs:125-127);
   - start and nudge logs (adapter/claude_code.rs:259-260, 671-691);
   - --name (effect.rs:105-110, claude_code.rs:440-448);
   - the first turn /wake {seat} (controller/src/policy.rs:60);
